      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**电势差的单位** 利用公式(8-27)来建立电势差的单位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在国际单位制中，功的单位是焦耳，而电荷的单位是库仑. 因",
        "此，如果 **1库仑的电荷从一点移到另一点时电场所做的功为",
        "1焦耳，则两点间的电势差等于1焦耳/库仑. 这个单位叫做",
        "伏特**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在静电单位制中，把移动1个静电单位的电荷电场所做",
        "的功为1尔格，作为电势差的单位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个单位之间的关系为："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$1\\text{伏特}=\\frac{1\\text{焦耳}}{1\\text{库仑}}=\\frac{10^7\\text{尔格}}{3\\times10^9\\text{静电制电量单位}}↵=\\frac{1}{300}\\text{静电制电势差单位}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "75. 点电荷电场的电势"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "推导点电荷电场的电势公式，不是简单的，我们不去推导",
        "而引入电势的公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在国际单位制中，点电荷电场的电势等于"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$U=\\frac{q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r}$. (8-28)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在静电单位制中，"
      ]
    },
